@startuml F3.2-D02-evento-concluido
title F3.2-D02 — Evento CONCLUIDO (imutável)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EventController" as Ctrl
participant "GetEventUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: abre evento CONCLUIDO
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /events/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT evento
Postgres --> UC: CONCLUIDO
note right of UC
  Suprime _links.editar
  e _links.excluir
end note
UC --> Ctrl: payload read-only
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: campos disabled\n+ banner info

@enduml
